# Base URL of the REST backend that serves portfolio, shop, and UI translations.
# Leave empty (or unset) to use bundled local sample data and static locale JSON.
#
# When set, the app fetches:
#   GET ${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/homepage       -> HomepageContent (hero, featured collections, category promos)
#   GET ${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/collections     -> Collection[]
#   GET ${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/products        -> Product[]
#   GET ${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/translations/en -> translation JSON (UI strings)
#   GET ${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/translations/fr -> translation JSON (UI strings)
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
